    "source": "analytic",
    "note": "the wedge's slanted edges run from (5, +-0.5, 0) to (10, +-0.5, 40) on the loft's side: the sections touch them as the plain loft does: a frustum 10 -> 20 over 40, h / 3 (A1 + A2 + sqrt(A1 A2))"
